      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to introduce to the market this outstanding three-bedroom semi-detached residence in the highly sought-after Pine Grove development. Bright, spacious and exceptionally well maintained, No. 28 offers comfortable family accommodation in a location close to Raheen Business Park, the Crescent Shopping Centre, University Hospital Limerick, schools, the recreation park and the many amenities that the hugely popular southside suburb of Raheen and Dooradoyle area has to offer.The Motorway network is also easily accessible.\n\nThe property benefits from excellent off-street parking and mature gardens to the front and rear. Its south facing rear garden enjoys abundant afternoon and evening sunshine and includes a very pleasant patio area. A second reception room to the side provides welcome flexibility for family living/home office. This exceptional home will appeal to families, first-time buyers, right sizers and investors alike.\n\nAccommodation\n\n\nEntrance hall 1.8 m × 3.8 m \nA bright and inviting entrance hall accessed through a recently installed composite front door. Features tiled flooring and useful under-stairs storage.\n\nSitting room 3.4 m × 3.8m A pleasant front facing reception room overlooking the garden, with semi solid timber flooring, a fireplace incorporating a solid fuel stove and double doors opening into the kitchen/dining room.\n\nKitchen/dining room: 5.3m X 4.0m \nA bright and welcoming space fitted with generous floor and eye-level Shrewsbury cream cabinetry, integrated appliances, and attractive floor and wall tiling.\n\nUtility 2.8m X 2.0m Tiled with built in presses. Door to rear garden WC & WHB off with tiling.\n\nSecond reception room\n: 4.6m x 2.7m situated to the side of the house, this additional room offers flexible space for family use/home office.\n\nFirst floor\n\nLanding: \nCarpeted with a hot press and Stira access to the attic.\n\nBedroom 1 3.3 m × 3.1 m\n A double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, with laminate flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 3.3 m × 3.6 m \nA bright and pleasant bedroom overlooking the front garden with laminate flooring and wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 2.5 m × 2.3 m\n A single bedroom with laminate flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nMain bathroom 2.1 m × 1.8 m \nBeautifully fitted, with floor and wall tiling and modern sanitary ware.\n\nFeatures:\n\n\nSouthwest facing and sun drenched rear garden with patio area.\n\n\nMature gardens to the front and rear.\n\n\nExcellent off-street parking.\n\n\nAdditional reception room ideal for families or as a home office .\n\nOil-fired central heating.\n\n\nDouble-glazed uPVC windows\n.\n\nStira attic access.\n\nSecurity alarm.\n\nGarden shed and boiler house.\n\n\nConvenient location close to major employers, amenities and the Motorway network.\n\nSensible price point.\n\nInspection very highly recommended."
      },
